  <2>18. CASE CloseWriter(c2)
          BY <2>0, <2>18, SMT DEF  CloseWriter, BindingMayDowncall,
           L1!EndSend, L1!L0!EndSend, RingTail, ManagedTypeOK, L1!TypeOK,
           L1!vars, L1!l0_vars, L1!ffi_vars, L1!L0!vars, L1!L0!RuntimeVars,
