             L1!L0!RuntimeVars, L1!L0!ChannelVars, L1!L0!CallVars,
             L1!EmitWriteDone, L1!IsAwaitingWriteDone, L1!IsWriteDoneCallbackRunning
    <1>g4. PrologueReaderOnlyWaits'
