             L1!L0!TypeOK
      <2>q. QED
          BY <2>w, SMT DEF RootSurvivesCallbacks,
             L1!DeliveryCallbackReturns, L1!IsDeliveryCallbackRunning,
             L1!IndInv, L1!TypeOK, L1!L0!TypeOK
