           ManagedRuntimeVars, ManagedChannelVars, ManagedCallVars,
           ReaderVars, WriterVars
  <2>8. CASE FinishCancelledParse(c2)
          BY <2>0, <2>8, SMT DEF  FinishCancelledParse, ConsumingTerminal,
