           managed_vars, ManagedRuntimeVars, ManagedChannelVars,
           ManagedCallVars, ReaderVars, WriterVars
  <2>14. CASE FinishDisposeCall(c2)
          BY <2>0, <2>14, SMT DEF  FinishDisposeCall, RingDrained,
