  <2>20. CASE TerminalCallbackReturns(c2)
          BY <2>0, <2>20, SMT DEF  TerminalCallbackReturns,
           L1!DeliveryCallbackReturns, L1!vars, L1!ffi_vars, L1!l0_vars,
