           L1!L0!HasStatus, ManagedIndInv, ManagedTypeOK, PayloadOwed,
           L1!HostOwnsSomePayload, L1!OwedPayloads, L1!TypeOK, L1!L0!TypeOK,
           ManagedStutter, vars, l1_vars, managed_vars, ManagedRuntimeVars,
