  <2>15. CASE SettleCall(c2)
          BY <2>0, <2>15, SMT DEF  SettleCall, RingDrained, ManagedTypeOK,
           IsLastRelease, ChannelSettled, ManagedStutter, vars, l1_vars,
           managed_vars, ManagedRuntimeVars, ManagedChannelVars,
