           ManagedChannelVars, ManagedCallVars, ReaderVars, WriterVars
  <2>6. CASE ResolveChannelDispose(ch2)
          BY <2>0, <2>6, SMT DEF  ResolveChannelDispose,
           ChannelDisposeMayResolve, L1!vars, L1!ffi_vars, L1!l0_vars,
