           L1!L0!CallVars, LastHolderAwaitsItsRuntime, ManagedIndInv,
           ManagedTypeOK, L1!IsRuntimeDestroyed, IsLastRelease,
           ChannelSettled, L1!TypeOK, L1!L0!TypeOK, ManagedStutter, vars,
