           [Next]_vars
    PROVE  \/ (channel_dispose_state[chId] = "released")'
           \/ (channel_dispose_state[chId] = "disposed")'
<1>0. CASE UNCHANGED vars
    BY <1>0, SMT DEF  ManagedTypeOK, IsLastRelease, ChannelSettled,
