  <2>1. CASE AcquireLease(ch2)
          BY <2>0, <2>1, SMT DEF  AcquireLease, ManagedTypeOK, IsLastRelease,
           ChannelSettled, ChannelDisposeMayResolve, ManagedStutter, vars,
