  <2>11. CASE BeginDisposeCall(c2)
          BY <2>0, <2>11, SMT DEF  BeginDisposeCall, ManagedTypeOK,
           IsLastRelease, ChannelSettled, ChannelDisposeMayResolve,
           ManagedStutter, vars, l1_vars, managed_vars, ManagedRuntimeVars,
